     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Hello,<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I created a new display using makeDisplay, followed by a webSync. I checked the vdb repo on the remote server and confirmed that the remote repo has the new displays.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">However when I force a reload of the Shiny app - i don&#39;t see the new displays.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Any reasons where this could be located?<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Regards<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:small\">Saptarshi<br><br><br></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
